t know that. The boy only treats her as a friend.\n\n🍮🌸Shohei x Tomoyo: delinquent looking boy x cheerful and kind girl (reference: https://sta.sh/2a0lquca3bh?edit=1) Ideas: petting a cat together, eating pudding, Tomoyo giving Shohei a bandaid, etc \n\nSensei can draw freely! Sketches are okay too! Something interactive would be cute though 💓\n\nPlease feel free to cancel or reject if this request is difficult! Thank you.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@fumifumi_game/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0b17140d/uploads/origins/710c44c7-e760-4fa9-8013-cb4602c3098e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9309c2daeb0ec278e212fd3fe6ca726e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0b17140d/uploads/origins/710c44c7-e760-4fa9-8013-cb4602c3098e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9309c2daeb0ec278e212fd3fe6ca726e, https://si.imgix.net/0b17140d/uploads/origins/710c44c7-e760-4fa9-8013-cb4602c3098e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b80d8df2a1679c7dd11f76d69aa563cf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0b17140d/uploads/origins/710c44c7-e760-4fa9-8013-cb4602c3098e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4ff3e0dec9862e504baff5ca07caa93 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "性別:小学校高学年の女の子\n瞳色:赤よりのピンク\n髪型:前髪パッツン姫カットで高い位置でツインおだんご＋なにかアレンジして欲しいです！\n髪色:さくらピンク\n服装:ふりふりのブラウスとスカート\nポーズ:全身が見える感じ\n表情:ちょっと困った感じ\n雰囲気:おどおどしてそうな感じ\n表情差分の有無(有の場合、差分表情を記載):笑った顔とうるうる顔\n服装差分(〃):なし", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@fumifumi_game/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/87d04a85/uploads/origins/1ed6b162-3418-43d0-af4e-122d310379d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4743cf815c1ce970da2ac415892ed52d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87d04a85/uploads/origins/1ed6b162-3418-43d0-af4e-122d310379d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=t